## SSL Feature Extractors (ONNX checkpoints)

The optional ONNX feature extractors for HuBERT and Wav2Vec2-BERT are derived
from models originally released by:

- microsoft/distilhubert — Apache 2.0
  https://huggingface.co/microsoft/distilhubert

- facebook/wav2vec2-bert — Apache 2.0
  https://huggingface.co/facebook/wav2vec2-bert-CV16-en

Pre-exported ONNX checkpoints are hosted at
https://huggingface.co/TigreGotico/wakehubert-onnx and
https://huggingface.co/TigreGotico/wav2vec2bert-onnx under the same
Apache 2.0 terms.


